---

import TitleSubtitle from "../UI/TitleSubtitle.astro";
---
<section class="py-14 container mx-auto text-center lg:text-left lg:w-1/2 px-4">
    <TitleSubtitle title="Professional Expertise" />
    <div class="mt-4">
        <p>
            As a graduate of the National Technological University (Universidad Tecnológica Nacional or UTN) with a Higher Technical Degree in Programming (Técnico Superior en Programación),
            I bring a solid academic foundation to my technical skills. My expertise spans:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc ml-8">
            <li>
                <strong>Full Stack Development</strong>: Crafting end-to-end solutions that bridge frontend and backend technologies.
            </li>
            <li class="mt-4">
                <strong>Web Development</strong>: Specializing in modern frontend technologies like Vue and Nuxt.js.
            </li>
            <li class="mt-4">
                <strong>Cloud Services</strong>: Designing and implementing robust cloud-based architectures in AWS or Firebase.
            </li>
            <li class="mt-4">
                <strong>System Analysis</strong>: Experienced translating complex client requirements into clear, actionable software specifications.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
